DesignKit

This module is a native SwiftUI port of the design system of Intent
(https://github.com/intent-hq/cloudlands-fe), licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. Copyright 2026 The Intent Authors.

Ported from that project: color role values (src/lib/styles/tokens.css), the type
scale, spacing, control sizes, radii, elevation and motion tiers, component recipes
(button, badge, tabs, text entry, rows, menus, settings, screen states) and the
written rules in docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md. They were translated from CSS/Svelte to
Swift; no source files were copied verbatim. Changes: reimplemented for SwiftUI on
macOS, adapted to native menus and windows, and reduced to what Capture uses.

The Intent name, logo, loader mark and sounds are not used and are not covered by
this port. A copy of the Apache License 2.0 is at
https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Bundled fonts (Resources/Fonts), each under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:
  Inter 4.1 (rsms/inter), Source Serif 4 4.005 (adobe-fonts/source-serif),
  JetBrains Mono 2.304 (JetBrains/JetBrainsMono). Licenses are beside the fonts.
